    <node id="&quot;CLIMATE CHANGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1"> Climate Change, a long-term phenomenon, encompasses significant alterations in weather patterns that impact various aspects of the environment. This global issue is particularly relevant to crop production, as it can influence and potentially affect crop yields.</data>
      <data key="d2">52ee86eeb7a4159163433b606cbd351f,f4a4076acb05f26b4bcd0b54144b5cbf,f9259ad40265a9f8f0dff292689b9e7a</data>
