    <node id="&quot;CHINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1"> In China, a significant focus is given to the discussion of carbon dynamics within its terrestrial ecosystems. This geographical location is also the site where the yields of both rice and wheat are under examination. Furthermore, China serves as the study area for long-term research on the effects of fertilizer application and straw return on soil carbon storage in croplands.</data>
      <data key="d2">1bb5cfc46b43ea1f79209969648d8950,b19bf40e09f0e348acd74a98b937d8fd,e050ec26f0af3db7a9cbd7e8e8b651c8</data>
